{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01QojFGXkjdJfCcc7iAsDT5N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Anchor R&D Control Surface â€” Master Plan (Planning Session Summary)\n\n- **North Star (locked):** Transform Anchor from a task/project tracker into a **per-project R&D control surface** â€” each code project is a folder (e.g. `C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home`, `C:\\dev\\Anchor`), and a single-instance dashboard window drives the **researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman** trio.\n\n- **Jobs are durable and server-owned:** the trio runs as durable Claude Code jobs **owned by the Anchor server on gwl-server**, with versioned effort history, taskâ†”project integration, project lifecycle states, deliverable execution, and a data-free public distribution.\n\n- **D1 â€” One uniform job primitive:** a job = `claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json` running the relevant **skill** (researchPrime / crucible / foreman) in the project cwd. The **lane** is just which skill + prompt template â€” **no per-lane orchestration code, no PTY, stdlib only.**\n\n- **D2 â€” Gate handling is in-session:** a skill's `AskUserQuestion` gate **surfaces in the stream** (auto-dismisses headless, but the structured question stays visible); Anchor renders it in a prompt box and **sends the user's choice back as a plain text turn** to continue the run.\n\n- **Brownfield extension:** the project is a **brownfield extend of Anchor** (`C:\\dev\\Anchor`); objective = new capability (not a greenfield rewrite).\n\n- **Session model = streaming console, stdlib-only:** a streaming console rather than a full TUI â€” **no PTY, no dependencies.**\n\n- **Registry = new parallel R&D registry:** distinct from the existing life-domain projects registry.\n\n- **Artifacts live inside each project's `.anchor/`:** stored as **pointer-records**, while the engine's native outputs stay in their native form.\n\n- **v1 scope = all three trio lanes, Claude Code CLI only:** Gemini support is **deferred**.\n\n- **Auth = run the Anchor service as `john`:** chosen to resolve the **LocalSystem credential wall**.\n\n- **Remote access = Tailscale interface bind + shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*` endpoints.\n\n- **Provenance:** decisions and the adversarial findings that drove them are recorded in the **Decision Log (Crucible, 2026-06-07/08)**; the frozen design spans the Master Plan, Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, and Decision Log."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":55544,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f70c320-3db2-44a7-b2a7-69a355864c8c","uuid":"085d7cf7-fdd9-40aa-bf53-5e2c9d1098e5","request_id":"req_011Cc52tLxod8LZYRSghQkVw"}
